## The parts of the manager screen this package contributes, in the order they load, one file name on a line.
## `LocalManagerScreen.Constants.py` is the screen's vocabulary and is required: a screen without it refuses to start.
## A comment starts with `#`.

LocalManagerScreen.Constants.py
LocalManagerScreen.Dashboard.py
LocalManagerScreen.Places.py
LocalManagerScreen.Workspace.py
LocalManagerScreen.Machine.py
LocalManagerScreen.SiblingRoots.py
LocalManagerScreen.Subsystems.py
LocalManagerScreen.Scopes.py
LocalManagerScreen.Features.py
